/P 337 0 R
/E (Commercial three-wheeler EVs are widely used for last-mile delivery and passenger transport, operating under heavy daily use, frequent stop-start cycles, and strict cost constraints. Key challenges include long charging times, battery degradation, safety concerns, and limited monitoring. This project aims to develop a system integrating fast charging, TPMS, and smart features to enhance efficiency, safety, and vehicle uptime.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
