/E (AI is integrated within the Vehicle Control Unit \(VCU\) and cloud platform, utilizing real-time data from the BMS, TPMS, and motor controller via CAN communication. By analyzing voltage, current, temperature, and pressure trends, it performs State of Health \(SOH\) estimation, predictive fault detection, and adaptive charging optimization. This enables early anomaly detection, improved range prediction, optimized energy usage, and predictive maintenance, thereby increasing vehicle uptime and operational reliability for commercial applications.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [69]
>>
endobj
