/E (The proposed system offers a wide range of solutions to ensure the efficiency of commercial three-wheeler EVs. The proposed system includes fast charging, battery management, TPMS, and AI monitoring. The proposed system helps to solve the most critical issues in three-wheeler EVs, such as long charging times, battery health, safety, and a lack of timely monitoring. The proposed system optimizes energy efficiency, predictive maintenance, and operational efficiency.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [82]
>>
endobj
505 0 obj
<<
